<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="background-color: white">Although Proposal No. 3 was approved
by the Company&#8217;s stockholders, the chair of the Special Meeting did not elect to adjourn the meeting, as all of the foregoing proposals
were also approved.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"></p>

